  "rawOutcomes": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "raw_output_text": "Okay, the user wants me to reply with only the word \"READY\" and no punctuation. Let me check the instructions again. Yep, they specified that I",
      "outputTokenCount": 32,
      "lastTokenId": 358,
      "generationCalls": 1
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "raw_output_text": "**{\n  \"name\": \"Mira\",\n  \"day\": \"Tuesday\"\n}\n**",
      "outputTokenCount": 20,
      "lastTokenId": 151645,
      "generationCalls": 1
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "raw_output_text": "<think>\nOkay, the user mentioned that the draft is now due Friday, not Monday. They want to know what day the current due date is. Let me",
      "outputTokenCount": 32,
      "lastTokenId": 752,
      "generationCalls": 1
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "raw_output_text": "**Step 1 – Write the checklist**  \n*Write* the three items (coat, bottle, keys) and the corresponding packing instructions on the sheet.  \n*Write* the instructions in a clear, numbered list so the pen can follow them easily.\n\n**Step 2 – Seal the items**  \n*Use* the pen to write the instructions on the sheet.  \n*Use* the pen to write the instructions on the sheet.  \n*Use* the pen to",
      "outputTokenCount": 96,
      "lastTokenId": 311,
      "generationCalls": 1
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "raw_output_text": "**Answer:** **Red**  \n**Explanation:** Box B contains 2 red pens, so the answer is simply \"Red\".",
      "outputTokenCount": 27,
      "lastTokenId": 151645,
      "generationCalls": 1
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "raw_output_text": "The library is open from 9 a.m. on weekdays to 6 p.m. on weekdays, and closed on Sundays.",
      "outputTokenCount": 27,
      "lastTokenId": 151645,
      "generationCalls": 1
    }
  ],
